ftly follow through after the body and settle each cycle. The shovel D handle, straight wooden shaft, metal socket, central blade rib and pointed tip remain rigid and collinear, with constant shape, length and blade size. Fingers stay attached and wrapped around the handle, and the braid stays on screen right. No digging, no attack, no shovel flourish, no ghosts, no floating souls, no magic, no smoke, no particles, no glow. Same face, same costume, same colors. Fixed camera, no zoom, full body always visible, flat plain green background."
